<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - RJR Nabisco estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - RJR Nabisco estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Martin Feldman said he raised his 1996, 1997 and 1998 earnings forecasts on RJR Nabisco Holdings Corp.</p>
<p>-- His 1996 view rose to $2.61 from $2.60, 1997 to $2.94 from $2.90 and 1998 to $3.35 from $3.30.</p>
<p>-- The company's &quot;EPS growth momentum is accelerating,&quot; Feldman said in a report.</p>
<p>-- He rates the stock accumulate.</p>
</text>
